    {
      "id": "OzS91DoyYsjGoH2l6s8Rj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3816.5462094800423,
      "y": 7386.386770064399,
      "width": 921.8804277741367,
      "height": 444.34262171933756,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 720503004,
      "version": 1188,
      "versionNonce": 2127691297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "U585cRk5rMyTd1hbyzfRw",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1756029972059,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Obtaining the LICENSE for the Figaf Application \n4. Adding the PI/PO Agent in the Configuration Section \n5. Synchronize the Objects , Mapping etc present in the PI/PO \n    System\n6. Adding the INtegraiton Suite Agent\n    a. Integration flow , API credentials , with SSO URL \n    b. Create a new Trust configuration with the Entity XML \n        Descriptor\n    c. Adding the Necessary Roles like PI Administrator , Business \n       Expert etc \n    d. Establish the Trust Configuration \n    e. Subscribe to the Cloud Identity Services as we are connecting \n       to a third party system. ",
      "fontSize": 27.34416133657462,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Obtaining the LICENSE for the Figaf Application \n4. Adding the PI/PO Agent in the Configuration Section \n5. Synchronize the Objects , Mapping etc present in the PI/PO \n    System\n6. Adding the INtegraiton Suite Agent\n    a. Integration flow , API credentials , with SSO URL \n    b. Create a new Trust configuration with the Entity XML \n        Descriptor\n    c. Adding the Necessary Roles like PI Administrator , Business \n       Expert etc \n    d. Establish the Trust Configuration \n    e. Subscribe to the Cloud Identity Services as we are connecting \n       to a third party system. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
