      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "U585cRk5rMyTd1hbyzfRw",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1756029972059,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Install the Java Version on the ON-Premise version \n2. https://figaf.com/trial/download-page/  and download the\n    figaf-tool-24*.jar\n3. Add a Batfile and Configure it with the url you want to \n    access the figaf from like https://localhost:8080 and \n    give the Address of the jar file that you have downloaded\n    before and run the batfile.  \n    ",
      "fontSize": 27.34416133657462,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Install the Java Version on the ON-Premise version \n2. https://figaf.com/trial/download-page/  and download the\n    figaf-tool-24*.jar\n3. Add a Batfile and Configure it with the url you want to \n    access the figaf from like https://localhost:8080 and \n    give the Address of the jar file that you have downloaded\n    before and run the batfile.  \n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
