    {
      "id": "pc3MouyMiZwUrgqHb6vJP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6601.337577027383,
      "y": -2253.2854413002733,
      "width": 2586.800537109375,
      "height": 671.6964781753481,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1214717583,
      "version": 652,
      "versionNonce": 1672577967,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756029994103,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Effort Estimation Using Migration Assessment in Migration Tool and Categorize them \n    With T-shirt Size (or) Simple , Moderate , Complex nature \n2. Comparing the Current & To be Landscape \n3. A high-level architecture for the connected systems and a list of these systems with\n    the protocols, adapters, triggers, and authentication used.\n4. Inventory existing interfaces (Adapter Type, Protocols, Sync/Async, Mappings)\n5. Identify Identify obsolete and redundant interfaces. \n6. Check the feasibility of Pre-Exsiting Packages or API present in Business accelertor \n    hub.",
      "fontSize": 59.7063536155865,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Effort Estimation Using Migration Assessment in Migration Tool and Categorize them \n    With T-shirt Size (or) Simple , Moderate , Complex nature \n2. Comparing the Current & To be Landscape \n3. A high-level architecture for the connected systems and a list of these systems with\n    the protocols, adapters, triggers, and authentication used.\n4. Inventory existing interfaces (Adapter Type, Protocols, Sync/Async, Mappings)\n5. Identify Identify obsolete and redundant interfaces. \n6. Check the feasibility of Pre-Exsiting Packages or API present in Business accelertor \n    hub.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lKZeYpAQEDUZfAopNYuy0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 849.1143822863196,
      "y": -80.06998024495374,
      "width": 3285.8930311297427,
      "height": 861.3087754276726,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
