      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "58708wVRBUJZ0A-_lLg24",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 903.2896448566553,
      "y": 27.019702089514794,
      "width": 3124.514892578125,
      "height": 871.7086341770307,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b10",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 213731151,
      "version": 576,
      "versionNonce": 915941295,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756030132673,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Define migration strategy: Phased or Big Bang.\n2. Prioritize integration scenarios depending on customer-specific aspects, for example business or functional \n    requirements, and availability of features on Cloud Integration. \n3. Side-by-side migration{Co-Existence Model}: Scenarios can be converted and run in parallel to SAP Process \n    Orchestration.\n4. Identify responsible stakeholders\n5. Automatically migrated (depending on the features of the Migration Tooling)\n6. Semiautomatically migrated (Migration Tooling, import of mappings, import of artifacts)\n7. Redesigning scenarios (standard content, standard APIs, interfaces not covered by the Migration Tooling \n    and third-party migration tools like figaf) \n\n",
      "fontSize": 58.113908945135385,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Define migration strategy: Phased or Big Bang.\n2. Prioritize integration scenarios depending on customer-specific aspects, for example business or functional \n    requirements, and availability of features on Cloud Integration. \n3. Side-by-side migration{Co-Existence Model}: Scenarios can be converted and run in parallel to SAP Process \n    Orchestration.\n4. Identify responsible stakeholders\n5. Automatically migrated (depending on the features of the Migration Tooling)\n6. Semiautomatically migrated (Migration Tooling, import of mappings, import of artifacts)\n7. Redesigning scenarios (standard content, standard APIs, interfaces not covered by the Migration Tooling \n    and third-party migration tools like figaf) \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
