    {
      "id": "yg4d1yrErcF5dB2RqyRVq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1536.0330892589252,
      "y": 3947.526403327921,
      "width": 2697.9221726250357,
      "height": 406.46245674743415,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 502084303,
      "version": 529,
      "versionNonce": 1748290497,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756029925897,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. BTP administrative tasks comes into the picture[ Enforcing SOD's(Segragration of Duties) ] \n2. Set up BTP Subaccount and enable Integration Suite along with setting up Migration Tool & Figaf\n3. Establish Cloud Connector and secure connectivity\n4. Set up SFTP, OAuth, JDBC connections, transports (CTMS or manual)\n5. Test the connectivity to the connected applications. \n6. Setup implementation guidelines and architecture (if you plan to redesign integration scenarios)",
      "fontSize": 54.19499423299123,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. BTP administrative tasks comes into the picture[ Enforcing SOD's(Segragration of Duties) ] \n2. Set up BTP Subaccount and enable Integration Suite along with setting up Migration Tool & Figaf\n3. Establish Cloud Connector and secure connectivity\n4. Set up SFTP, OAuth, JDBC connections, transports (CTMS or manual)\n5. Test the connectivity to the connected applications. \n6. Setup implementation guidelines and architecture (if you plan to redesign integration scenarios)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
